# Ignore everything…
*
# …except directories (otherwise Git won't look inside them)
!*/
# …and the files to keep
!*.tf
!*.tfvars
!*.txt
!*.md
!.gitignore
# The .tfvars files here hold lesson values only.
# Never put secrets in them: use TF_VAR_ / ARM_ environment variables.

# Never commit these
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
*_override.tf
